    },
    {
      "occurrence": 85,
      "number": 250,
      "number_raw": "250",
      "source_number": "250",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The back-mounted TX-28 MircoFusion Pack generates 60,000 Watts to power the HiFlo hydraulic systems built into the frame of the suit. ",
      "source_text": "The back-mounted TX-28 MircoFusion Pack generates 60,000 Watts to power\n the HiFlo hydraulic systems built into the frame of the suit. ",
      "source_line_start": 139,
      "source_line_end": 140,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 86,
      "number": 251,
      "number_raw": "251",
      "source_number": "251",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Made of the latest poly-laminate composite, the T-51b shell is lightweight and capable of absorbing over 2500 Joules of kinetic impact. ",
      "source_text": "Made of the latest poly-laminate composite, the T-51b shell is lightweight\n and capable of absorbing over 2500 Joules of kinetic impact. ",
      "source_line_start": 141,
      "source_line_end": 142,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 87,
      "number": 252,
      "number_raw": "252",
      "source_number": "252",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The 10 micron silver ablative coating can reflect laser and radiation emissions without damage to the composite subsurface.",
      "source_text": "The 10 micron silver ablative coating can reflect laser and radiation\n emissions without damage to the composite subsurface.",
      "source_line_start": 143,
      "source_line_end": 144,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 88,
      "number": 232,
      "number_raw": "232",
      "source_number": "232",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "FEV Summary Digest:                                                     2073. As China became increasingly aggressive with their use of biological weapons, the United States government felt that a countermeasure was needed. The Pan-Immunity Virion Project (PVP) was officially formed September 15, 2073. ",
      "source_text": "FEV Summary Digest:\n                                                     2073. As China became increasingly aggressive with their use of\n biological weapons, the United States government felt that a countermeasure was needed. The\n Pan-Immunity Virion Project (PVP) was officially formed September 15, 2073. ",
      "source_line_start": 145,
      "source_line_end": 148,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 89,
      "number": 233,
      "number_raw": "233",
      "source_number": "233",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "2075. It became clear that the best way to combat the newly created biological weapons was to alter uninfected DNA so that it was no longer susceptible to standard viral infection.",
      "source_text": "2075. It became clear that the best way to combat the newly created\n biological weapons was to alter uninfected DNA so that it was no longer susceptible to standard\n viral infection.",
      "source_line_start": 149,
      "source_line_end": 151,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 90,
      "number": 234,
      "number_raw": "234",
      "source_number": "234",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "2076. Unforseen side effects began surfacing in early 2076 with the PVP. Animal test subjects began showing an abnormal growth rate accompanied by increased brain activity. ",
      "source_text": "2076. Unforseen side effects began surfacing in early 2076 with the\n PVP. Animal test subjects began showing an abnormal growth rate accompanied by increased brain\n activity. ",
      "source_line_start": 152,
      "source_line_end": 154,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 91,
      "number": 235,
      "number_raw": "235",
      "source_number": "235",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The U.S. government took notice of these discoveries, and in the interests of national security, moved a team on-site to secure and oversee the project, which was now dubbed the FEV (Forced Evolutionary Virus) project.",
      "source_text": "The U.S. government took notice of these discoveries, and in the interests of national\n security, moved a team on-site to secure and oversee the project, which was now dubbed the FEV\n (Forced Evolutionary Virus) project.",
      "source_line_start": 155,
      "source_line_end": 157,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 92,
      "number": 236,
      "number_raw": "236",
      "source_number": "236",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "2077. FEV nears completion. Test on lab animals are at a near 100% success rate. Size and muscle density increase approximately 60%, and the protential intelligence increase by 200%. ",
      "source_text": "2077. FEV nears completion. Test on lab animals are at a near 100%\n success rate. Size and muscle density increase approximately 60%, and the protential intelligence\n increase by 200%. ",
      "source_line_start": 158,
      "source_line_end": 160,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 93,
      "number": 237,
      "number_raw": "237",
      "source_number": "237",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Effects upon human subjects remain unknown; although they are theoretically promising. ",
      "source_text": "Effects upon human subjects remain unknown; although they are theoretically\n promising. ",
      "source_line_start": 161,
      "source_line_end": 162,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 94,
      "number": 238,
      "number_raw": "238",
      "source_number": "238",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The military, wishing to continue further testing, builds a large facility at the Mariposa military installation in central California. At this new facility, testing of the FEV virus continues on volunteer subjects from the military.",
      "source_text": "The military, wishing to continue further testing, builds a large facility at the\n Mariposa military installation in central California. At this new facility, testing of the FEV\n virus continues on volunteer subjects from the military.",
      "source_line_start": 163,
      "source_line_end": 165,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
